<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo grows 20.5 pct in Jan '97.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo grows 20.5 pct in Jan '97.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo continued its recent strong growth at Munich airport (MUC) in January with a 20.5 percent rise to 6,281 tonnes flown, Flughafen Muenchen GmbH said.</p>
<p>Details in tonne with percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>	     Total   Pct	     Exports	     Imports</p>
<p>  Jan    6,281   up  20.5    3,190   up 26.4    3,091   up 15.0</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
